# =============================================================
# image-models.manifest — the single source of truth for image-gen models
# =============================================================
# Parallel to config/models.manifest (LLM): upgrading/replacing an
# image model = edit only this file.
#
# Fields (pipe-separated): ROLE|MODEL_ID|HF_REPO|GEN_CLI|EDIT_CLI|BASE_MODEL_ARG|STEPS
#   ROLE           : primary=default  alt=alternative  retired=to delete
#   MODEL_ID       : short name within this stack (lm image --model <id> /
#                    Hermes image_gen.model)
#   HF_REPO        : weights source (used by lm pull-image; downloaded to
#                    ~/models/image-gen/<basename>)
#   GEN_CLI        : mflux text-to-image command
#   EDIT_CLI       : image-to-image / edit command (empty if unsupported)
#   BASE_MODEL_ARG : --base-model value required by GEN_CLI (empty if not needed)
#   STEPS          : default sampling steps
#
# Weights directory rule: ~/models/image-gen/$(basename HF_REPO)/
# =============================================================

# ---- Current lineup v2.3 (2026-07-22) ----
primary|flux2-klein-4b|Runpod/FLUX.2-klein-4B-mflux-4bit|mflux-generate-flux2|mflux-generate-flux2-edit|flux2-klein-4b|4
alt|z-image-turbo|filipstrand/Z-Image-Turbo-mflux-4bit|mflux-generate-z-image-turbo|||9
